--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lazy-wave power cable with discrete buoyancy modules, restrained in torsion
-- The cable of lazy_wave_touchdown_planar_coarse_att.dat (25 discrete buoyancy modules at a 4 m pitch
-- from 80 m to 176 m), clamped at both ends and restrained in torsion (Rigid) with one turn of
-- pretwist at End B, and the polar inertia Irn = 1 kg m of its LINE TYPES row, so its dynamics carry
-- a twist angle at every node. The torsion stage runs on the discrete equilibrium, after the
-- attachment polish, with the modules' net weights (and, in a deck current, their drag) as nodal
-- loads. A still run from it keeps its torque, twist and fairlead tension.
